+ * 
+ * rtp interface for srtp reference implementation
+ *
+ * David A. McGrew
+ * Cisco Systems, Inc.
+ *
+ * data types:
+ *
+ * rtp_msg_t       an rtp message (the data that goes on the wire)
+ * rtp_sender_t    sender side socket and rtp info
+ * rtp_receiver_t  receiver side socket and rtp info
+ *
+ */
+
+/*
+ *	
